Disable TIP opfl and refinemv when a TIP reference is scaled.

AVM's is_optflow_refinement_enabled() and is_refinemv_allowed() return 0 for TIP blocks when
either TIP reference has a different size than the current frame. dav2d's tip_pred() and its
derive_lowest_px() counterpart did not check this and called mc_opfl() with a scaled
reference (assertion refp size == cur size, recon_tmpl.c:1737; mc_opfl() has no scaled path).
Adds tests/test_tip_scaled_refine.c.
Not fixed upstream as of 74bfb0ac; no MR found (2026-11-24).

